<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prŏboscis</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-moscis</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Sol. 24, 14</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-muscis</span></b> ,
			<i><span class="en">Cassiod. Var. 10, 30</span></i>),
			ĭdis, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβοσκίς</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a trunk</i>, <i>proboscis</i>, <i>a snout.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., Varr. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Non. 49, 11</span></i>; Auct. B. Afr. 84,
			2.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic., <i>the trunk</i> or <i>proboscis
				of an elephant</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">proboscidem amputare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 7, 7, § 18</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">28, 8, 24,
				§ 88</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">proboscide abscissā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					1, 18, 9</span></i>
			.</div>
